# Valkyrie's Call never loops (CR 700.4, 603.10a): the Memnite that dies on turn 3 returns as a flying Angel with a +1/+1 counter, and
# when Bot1 Bolts that 2/2 Angel on turn 5 it is an Angel as it dies, so the Call does not trigger for it and the Memnite stays in the
# graveyard. The first death, as a plain Construct, is the positive control.

